  "content": "\n\n<p>此模組為 Macaw 的模組與 Regions Unexplored 之間加入相容性。如果你曾經夢想過建造一座紅杉橋……那麼，多虧了這個模組，這已經成為可能了！</p>\n<p>生物菇相關內容：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1468/382/2026-01-14_22.png\"></p>\n<p>木蓮相關內容：<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1468/383/2026-01-14_22.png\"></p>\n<p>錦葵相關內容：<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1468/384/2026-01-14_23.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>必要依賴：</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/addonslib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>AddonsLib</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/regions-unexplored\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Regions Unexplored</a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>選用依賴：</strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sketch_macaw/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw 的模組</a></strong></p>",
